{
  "model_type": "kimi_musicgpt",
  "architectures": [
    "KimiMusicGPT"
  ],
  "comment": "Kimi-MusicGPT 1.5B production config (V100-SXM2-16GB). Backbone == configs/kimi_linear_1p5b_dense.json (hidden 2048, 24 layers = [kda,kda,kda,mla] x 6, dense FFN 5760); vocab 2056 = 2048 codebook + 8 special. Train PURE-FP16 (measured): --layout pure_fp16 --optimizer adamw8bit --batch-size 1; <=128 frames keep Kahan (peak 14.91 GiB), 200 frames add --no-kahan (peak 13.21 GiB); raise the effective batch with --accum-steps. KDA chunk_size set to 128 (the measured optimum on the V100: 45.05ms vs 65.96ms per layer fwd+bwd at 64; pure implementation parameter, same math).",
  "vocab_size": 2056,
